From 05f788216d33cc9b37a7ae41c59a98c492ef7287 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:33:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Samplers: a draw per generator only for the seeded requests

A draw per generator is slow on HPU. The sampler and the rejection sampler
drew every row that way as soon as one request of the batch had a seed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
---
